    "You choose which files and Library folders Quilter can access. You can clear recent documents, close documents, and remove local files using the standard macOS controls." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing the user's choices regarding the files and Library folders that Quilter can access.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
